name cmsrb
category Package
revision 54706
shortdesc Computer Modern for Serbian and Macedonian
longdesc This package provides provides Adobe Type 1 Computer Modern
longdesc fonts for the Serbian and Macedonian languages. Although the
longdesc cm-super package provides great support for cyrillic script in
longdesc various languages, there remains a problem with italic variants
longdesc of some letters for Serbian and Macedonian. This package
longdesc includes the correct shapes for italic letters \cyrb, \cyrg,
longdesc \cyrd, \cyrp, and \cyrt. It also offers some improvements in
longdesc letters and accents used in the Serbian language. Supported
longdesc encodings are: T1, T2A, TS1, X2 and OT2. The OT2 encoding is
longdesc modified so that it is now easy to transcribe Latin text to
longdesc Cyrillic.
execute addMap cmsrb.map
containersize 2299372
